<!--
    The brand ground, flat.

    `brand-600` from docs/brand.md rather than the in-app `brand` token: the
    icon is the one place the brand is allowed to be the loudest thing, and it
    is read against a launcher wallpaper nobody chose rather than against a
    known surface, so the AA figures the tokens carry do not apply here.

    Flat because an adaptive icon is masked, scaled and parallaxed by the
    launcher. A gradient survives none of that recognisably.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <path
        android:fillColor="#461060"
        android:pathData="M0,0h108v108h-108z" />
</vector>
